1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:02,110
(Leonard:)A little.

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:05,320
(Leslie:)There are so many things to talk about
before reproduction.

3
00:00:05,492 --> 00:00:07,242
(Leonard:)I sure hope so.

4
00:00:08,703 --> 00:00:12,083
(Leslie:)Besides shortness, what genetic
weaknesses run in your family?

5
00:00:13,208 --> 00:00:17,248
(Sheldon(entering):)I'm sorry to interrupt.
Battery's dying. Continue.

6
00:00:18,129 --> 00:00:21,969
(Leslie:)Uh, genetic weaknesses, right.
Um, there's the lactose intolerance.

7
00:00:22,133 --> 00:00:24,763
Don't forget the male-pattern baldness.

8
00:00:25,303 --> 00:00:29,763
(Sheldon(preparing an extension cord):)When his uncles sit around the dinner
table, they look like a half-carton of eggs.

9
00:00:49,369 --> 00:00:50,909
Okay, yeah, my uncles are bald...

10
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:55,289
(Leonard:)...but my Aunt Edna is one of the hairiest
women you'll ever meet, so, you know...

11
00:00:55,458 --> 00:01:01,018
(Leonard:)Sweet lady.
It always tickles when she hugs me.

